codex
The first TypeScript pass found one narrow typing issue: `TRAINING_DAYS` is declared as `Day[]`, while the helper return type excluded Sunday. I’m aligning the helper with the requested `Record<Day, Date>` shape and including Sunday as ISO day 7; the selector still renders only Monday–Saturday.
